  m_Name: Level1(1-D)
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - "If you could travel anywhere, where would you go? Is there a specific place
    you\u2019ve always wanted to see?"
  - "Japan. \r\nI\u2019ve always dreamed of returning there. The landscapes, artistry,
    and culture are where my heart truly belongs. There\u2019s a particular garden
    I remember, filled with wisteria trees."
  - "Their blooms were so breathtaking, so full of life\u2026 they inspired my most
    iconic design.\r\nI\u2019d give anything to see those trees again, to feel their
    petals brush against my skin. "
  - "It\u2019s where my creativity was born, and I feel most at home."
  responses: []
